<title>NEW ZEALAND: Owens buys Rhino Security, effective May 1.</title>
<headline>Owens buys Rhino Security, effective May 1.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Transport firm Owens Group Ltd said on Monday it had bought unlisted Rhino Security Corp for an undisclosed cash sum.</p>
<p>The purchase was effective from May 1 and the business would now trade under the name of Rhino Security, Owens said.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64-4-4734746)</p>
</text>
